WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:06.240
Police have failed to clear a major&nbsp;
bridge-crossing between the US and Canada.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:09.680
It's being blocked by truckers&nbsp;
protesting against vaccine rules.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:15.280
Police persuaded some drivers to move their&nbsp;
vehicles - but they reconvened later. The weekend&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:20.480
has also brought a fresh wave of protesters into&nbsp;
the Canadian capital, Ottawa, where a core group&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:31.840
of truckers continue to occupy the downtown area.
Taking their outrage to the government's doorstep.&nbsp;

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:37.600
It's been over two weeks now that the Freedom&nbsp;
Convoy has camped in the Canadian capital Ottawa.&nbsp;

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:44.960
A plan to force unvaccinated truck&nbsp;
drivers crossing between Canada and the US&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:52.080
to quarantine, sparked the initial rally.
But the demonstrators insist the blockade goes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:58.800
beyond opposing the rules on inoculations.
We're not here about vaccinations,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:03.440
and I could tell you 90 percent of the&nbsp;
truckers here are likely vaccinated,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:10.240
but we are here for the freedom of choice.
More Canadians need to wake up and realize&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:17.360
that our freedoms are being stripped away. It&nbsp;
is not normal for us to wear masks all day. I'm&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:22.960
sick and tired of it. I'm a teacher. Students&nbsp;
in the classroom are sick and tired of it too.&nbsp;

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:30.240
Police could not move the protesters off a border&nbsp;
crossing. It's one of the major corridors into the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:36.720
United States. The blockade has affected trade&nbsp;
and supply chains between the two countries.&nbsp;

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:44.640
It's also inspired support rallies over&nbsp;
the border to Buffalo in New York State,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:47.120
and as far away as New Zealand.&nbsp;

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:53.840
In the Netherlands - truckers&nbsp;
rolled through The Hague.&nbsp;

00:01:56.640 --> 00:02:01.520
Thousands of French police were deployed to&nbsp;
stop Convoy of Freedom from entering Paris,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:09.520
but some protesters made it.
They took aim at Vaccine Passes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:16.480
and President Emmanuel Marcon, but also&nbsp;
tapped into the discontent over rising prices.&nbsp;

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:25.520
Our rights, our freedoms are violated, we just&nbsp;
have the right to work, to spend and to be taxed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:30.080
The price of diesel increases, wheat&nbsp;
increases, sugar increases, insurance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:34.480
increases, everything increases.
Police cleared the streets using tear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:49.840
gas. But this has not ended the protests. Next&nbsp;
stop, the European Union's power-base in Brussels.

